<Placemark><name>Thumsee bemelegítő kör (10.6 km, 136 m)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Thumsee bemelegítő kör</b> – GENERÁLT NYOMVONAL<br/>Rövid, szállodából induló kör a legközelebbi tóhoz. Kirchbergen át a Thumsee-hez, a tóparton a Seewirtig, és egy másik úton vissza a városba. Ideális érkezésnapi tesztkörnek. (A Listsee felé vezető út meredek, ezért kimaradt.)<br/><br/>Táv: 10.6 km · Szint: 136 m · Max: 589 m · Idő: ~0.7 ó<br/>Nehézség: könnyű · Értékelés: ★★★★☆<br/>Burkolat: aszfalt 94.2%, kemény murva 5.8%, laza/erdei 0.0%, ösvény 0.0%<br/>Indulás: Közvetlenül a szálloda elől indul | Autóval ~8 perc: Parkplatz Seewirt, Thumsee | Vonattal: Bad Reichenhall-Kirchberg (~3 perc Bad Reichenhall Hbf-ről)<br/>Október: A Thumsee körül októberben sok a gyalogos – lassíts a part menti szakaszon. A Saalachsee gátján keskeny az út – lassíts, ha gyalogosok jönnek.]]></description><styleUrl>#konnyu</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>12.88384,47.7269,478 12.88437,47.72662,478 12.88435,47.72641,479 12.88387,47.72612,481 12.8838,47.72566,482 12.88319,47.725,481 12.88225,47.72454,476 12.88132,47.72493,474 12.88082,47.72441,472 12.88023,47.72441,470 12.87903,47.72332,472 12.87791,47.7224,474 12.87719,47.72264,475 12.87621,47.72143,474 12.8759,47.72098,474 12.87426,47.72149,472 12.87428,47.72178,472 12.87307,47.72199,472 12.87187,47.72278,471 12.87153,47.72252,471 12.87044,47.72276,469 12.86841,47.72278,469 12.86814,47.72277,470 12.86613,47.72258,469 12.86465,47.7223,470 12.86294,47.72163,468 12.8609,47.72097,468 12.86088,47.72096,468 12.85896,47.72054,466 12.85797,47.72039,465 12.85593,47.72024,466 12.85443,47.72019,466 12.85237,47.72026,467 12.85028,47.72044,473 12.85005,47.72043,473 12.84808,47.72009,482 12.84618,47.71985,488 12.84569,47.71962,489 12.84474,47.71871,500 12.84286,47.71824,515 12.84107,47.71776,527 12.83896,47.71771,520 12.83894,47.71771,520 12.837,47.71817,531 12.83659,47.71825,536 12.83435,47.71827,547 12.83228,47.71841,537 12.83164,47.