<Placemark><name>Waginger See dombos változat (Högl és Höglwörth) (93.7 km, 660 m)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Waginger See dombos változat (Högl és Höglwörth)</b> – GENERÁLT NYOMVONAL<br/>A tavas nagy kör dombosabb változata: a Högl dombhátján (Ulrichshögl) és a Höglwörther See kolostoránál kapaszkodsz a Rupertiwinkel dombjaira, Teisendorfon át érsz a Waginger See-hez és a Tachinger See-hez, majd Laufenen és a Salzach-ártéren át vissza Freilassing felé.<br/><br/>Táv: 93.7 km · Szint: 660 m · Max: 578 m · Idő: ~5.5 ó<br/>Nehézség: nehéz · Értékelés: ★★★★☆<br/>Burkolat: aszfalt 90.3%, kemény murva 6.3%, laza/erdei 0.0%, ösvény 3.4%<br/>Indulás: Közvetlenül a szálloda elől indul | Autóval ~20 perc: Teisendorf, P5 (Zentrum) | Vonattal: Laufen (Obb) (~45 perc Bad Reichenhall Hbf-ről)<br/>Október: Hosszú nap: legkésőbb 9-kor indulj. Rövid nap: Laufenben 15:30 után inkább szállj vonatra.]]></description><styleUrl>#nehez</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>12.88384,47.7269,472 12.88311,47.72749,471 12.88394,47.72772,471 12.88465,47.7287,469 12.88606,47.72973,468 12.88728,47.73071,466 12.8879,47.7317,465 12.88899,47.73286,463 12.8898,47.73392,464 12.8905,47.73518,463 12.89072,47.73556,462 12.89139,47.73623,461 12.89092,47.73659,461 12.8917,47.73719,461 12.89069,47.7378,461 12.89184,47.73892,461 12.89218,47.7393,463 12.89287,47.73953,464 12.89266,47.74002,465 12.89279,47.74025,466 12.89351,47.74042,465 12.89365,47.74087,466 12.89548,47.74164,466 12.89729,47.74241,460 12.89909,47.74319,456 12.90079,47.74393,455 12.9015,47.74425,455 12.90083,47.74488,455 12.90086,47.74625,457 12.90079,47.74668,457 12.89994,47.7476,458 12.90089,47.74871,467 12.9012,47.75015,469 12.90134,47.75059,468 12.90213,47.75158,466 12.9018,47.75229,466 12.9005,47.75313,473 12.89938,47.75441,473 12.89915,47.75474,470 12.89895,47.75552,465 12.8992,47.75692,459 12.8992,47.75697,459 12.89869,47.7579,459 12.89898,47.75829,459 12.9002,47.75849,458 12.90056,47.75895,458 12.90076,47.75